# AUWTC line-ending policy: store all text with LF; check out with LF.
# Every file type here (C#/XAML/XML/Markdown) is line-ending-insensitive, so this
# makes behavior repo-local (independent of each cloner's core.autocrlf) and keeps
# the Windows working tree byte-identical to the repo (no churn, no add warnings).
# If a file type that truly needs CRLF is ever added (e.g. *.bat), give it its own
# line here: "*.bat text eol=crlf"
* text=auto eol=lf
